544
00:39:48.208 --> 00:39:49.916
<i>♪ I can see him ♪</i>

545
00:39:50.000 --> 00:39:51.708
<i>♪ He can see me ♪</i>

546
00:39:51.791 --> 00:39:58.791
<i>♪ Happiness is whatever
You want it to be ♪</i>

